{'symbol': 'MOH', 'date': '2019-10-28 22:30:00', 'title': 'MOLINA HEALTHCARE, INC. REVISES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE YEAR 2019', 'text': 'MOLINA HEALTHCARE, INC. REVISED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE YEAR 2019. THE COMPANY RAISED ITS FULL YEAR 2019 EARNINGS GUIDANCE RANGE TO $11.30 - $11.55 PER DILUTED SHARE, FROM PREVIOUSLY ISSUED GUIDANCE OF $11.20 - $11.50. NET INCOME EXPECTED TO BE IN THE RANGE OF $725 MILLION TO $740 MILLION, TOTAL REVENUE EXPECTED TO BE $16.8 BILLION FROM PREVIOUSLY ISSUED GUIDANCE OF $16.7 BILLION.'}